{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "flux_divergence_duo_g2",
    "description": "Continuity (mass) tendency dh/dt for the duo gnomonic cubed-sphere shallow-water core, Ng=2 (Nc=3-point volume-mean reconstruction, design order 3). Discretises Chen (2021) Eqs 3-6 exactly as the Zenodo reference sw_full: dp/dt = (fx(i)-fx(i+1)+fy(j)-fy(j+1))/A with the LMARS face mass flux fx = u* * Lx * dp_upwind. u* is the LMARS normal velocity Eq 11 with the wave speed a=1/2(sqrt(dp_L)+sqrt(dp_R)) from CELL depth (the paper's build default, no inline_cs); the interface states come from raise-then-reconstruct: the contravariant u^1=(ua-cosA va)/sin^2 a (and v^2 on y-faces) is volume-mean reconstructed to the face and multiplied by the face sin(alpha), and dp is reconstructed and upwinded on sign(u*) (Eqs 14-15). Lx/Ly are the great-circle face lengths (duo_arc_length on the corner nodes); A is duo_cell_area; cosA at cells is duo_cos_alpha (node-sourced, spanning the N+6 halo the Ng=3 stencil reaches); face sin(alpha) is duo_tangent_cos at the face. Operates on the halo-EXTENDED prognostic fields (duo_extend output), so a single interior region [tile,x,y] tiles the whole tendency with no boundary stencil. Applied by name from the duo SWE problem. Method-of-lines: this is the pure spatial RHS (no rk2/rk3, no forward-backward).",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": [
      "esd:rule",
      "family:finite_volume",
      "grid:duo",
      "op:flux_divergence",
      "order:3",
      "bc:duo",
      "axes:tile,x,y",
      "form:flux",
      "stencil_width:3"
    ],
    "references": [
      {
        "citation": "Chen, X. (2021). The LMARS based shallow-water dynamical core on generic gnomonic cubed-sphere geometry. Journal of Advances in Modeling Earth Systems, 13(1), e2020MS002280.",
        "doi": "10.1029/2020MS002280"
      }
    ]
  },
  "expression_template_imports": [
    {
      "ref": "../grid.esm"
    },
    {
      "ref": "../stencils/flux_divergence_duo_g2_interior.esm"
    }
  ],
  "expression_templates": {
    "flux_divergence_duo_g2": {
      "params": [
        "dp",
        "ua",
        "va",
        "node",
        "center",
        "cosA",
        "area"
      ],
      "body": {
        "op": "makearray",
        "args": [],
        "regions": [
          [
            [
              1,
              6
            ],
            [
              1,
              "N"
            ],
            [
              1,
              "N"
            ]
          ]
        ],
        "values": [
          {
            "op": "apply_expression_template",
            "args": [],
            "name": "flux_divergence_duo_g2_interior",
            "bindings": {
              "dp": "dp",
              "ua": "ua",
              "va": "va",
              "node": "node",
              "center": "center",
              "cosA": "cosA",
              "area": "area"
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}